title: Go to Saxony
new-page: true
is-special: true
face-image: img/land/Saxony.svg.webp
on-arrival: {!
  setTimeout(function() {
    var el = document.getElementById('saxony');
    if (!el || typeof d3 === 'undefined' || !window.ParliamentData) return;
    el.removeAttribute('data-parliament');
    el.innerHTML = '';
    window.ParliamentData.renderParliament('saxony', el);
  }, 0);
!}

= Saxony

Saxony has historically been the country of literature and the printing industry - but it was not just that domain that lead to a proletarian and liberal state.

More recently Saxony has been the center of the Märzaktion, a coup attempt by the KPD and KAPD that sought to spark a late continuation of the November Revolution.

Currently ruled by [+ saxony_mp +] ([+ saxony_mp_party +]) in a [+ saxony_gov +]-Coalition with [+ saxony_coalition_r +]% support.

<div id="saxony" style="width:500px; height:250px;"></div>



- @coalition_saxony: Coalition
- @toleration_saxony: Toleration
- @policies_saxony: Policies
- @states: Exit Saxony



@coalition_saxony
choose-if: saxony_spd == 1
unavailable-subtitle: We are not part of the Coalition
go-to: saxony_state

This is where some new arrangments would be possible, some day

@toleration_saxony
choose-if: saxony_spd == 2
unavailable-subtitle: We are not in toleration


@policies_saxony
choose-if: saxony_spd == 1 and saxony_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if not saxony_spd == 1: We are not part of the Coalition. ?][? if saxony_spd == 1 and saxony_action_timer > 0: We have to wait [+ saxony_action_timer +] months before our next action. ?]



- @reform_the_administration
- @fund_workers_militias
- @give_tax_breaks_to_local_buisnesses


@reform_the_administration
title: Reform the administration of Saxony
on-arrival: saxony_reform += 1; saxony_action_timer += 7
go-to: saxony_state

@fund_workers_militias
title: Fund worker's militias
on-arrival: rfb_strength += 1; kpd_relation += 5; saxony_action_timer += 8
choose-if: saxony_gov == "SPD" or saxony_gov == "Social-Democratic" or saxony_gov == "Left" and not saxony_ddp == 2
go-to: saxony_state

@give_tax_breaks_to_local_buisnesses
title: Give tax breaks to local buisnesses
on-arrival: ddp_relation += 5; dvp_relation += 5; old_middle_spd += 3; workers_spd -= 2; saxony_action_timer += 9; saxony_action_timer -= 2 if saxony_dvp == 1
choose-if: not (saxony_kpd >= 1 or saxony_uspd >= 1 or saxony_sapd >= 1)
go-to: saxony_state














